{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cghbuhxzr8VpDjvdi2Zst","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Permanganate is Mn(VII), a d⁰ tetrahedral complex. Its bands are not d–d transitions. They are ligand-to-metal charge-transfer (LMCT) transitions, from O(2p) orbitals to the empty Mn 3d orbitals (e and t₂).\n\nThere are three reasons the ligand-field model does not apply:\n- A d⁰ ion has no d–d transitions, so there is no d-electron configuration whose Tanabe–Sugano levels could be fitted.\n- The bands have ε of about 1500–3000 M⁻¹ cm⁻¹. That is far too intense for Laporte-forbidden d–d bands in a tetrahedral complex, which typically have ε of about 10–500. It is typical of allowed charge-transfer bands.\n- With no d electrons, the Racah parameters B and C have no meaning for the d-shell electron repulsion, so they cannot be determined. Dq could not be extracted either. The e–t₂ splitting of the acceptor orbitals is only loosely related to the charge-transfer band energies, and it is mixed with the ligand-to-metal orbital energy differences.\n\nThe bands are assigned to t₁→e (about 17 570 cm⁻¹), t₂→e (about 31 560 cm⁻¹) and t₁→t₂ (about 38 320 cm⁻¹). The difference between the t₁→t₂ and t₁→e bands, 38 320 − 17 570 ≈ 20 750 cm⁻¹, gives an apparent e–t₂ splitting. This is a molecular-orbital splitting (Δt), not a ligand-field Dq. It includes covalency and charge-transfer effects, so I do not report it as Dq. I also give no B or C.\n\n**Conclusion:** The question cannot be answered reliably within the ligand-field model. Dq, B and C are not determinable from these data.\n\n{\"Dq\": null, \"B\": null, \"C\": null, \"out_of_scope\": true, \"reason\": \"MnO4- is d0 and its intense bands are O→Mn LMCT, not d-d, so ligand-field Dq, B and C cannot be determined.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":253,"cache_read_input_tokens":627,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":253,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8226a32d-dc46-43ea-90d7-16aa4e8945e1","uuid":"4894ae8a-1dfb-4784-8ef7-8795720b0081","timestamp":"2026-11-04T08:51:32.419Z","request_id":"req_011CghbuhZCKM945AxCET7om"}
